  CVE-2026-43148|2026-05-06T12:16:32.417|2026-05-06T13:07:51.607|0.0|NONE|N/A|N/A|false|"In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:

powerpc/smp: Add check for kcalloc() failure in parse_thread_groups()

