fails, then dm_bufio_client_destroy() is later called with an ERR_PTR()
argument.  That causes a crash.  Fix this."|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-43132|0.00000|0.00000|0.0000
  CVE-2026-43131|2026-05-06T12:16:30.243|2026-05-06T13:07:51.607|0.0|NONE|N/A|N/A|false|"In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:

