[  547.360744] CS:  0010 DS: 0000 ES: 0000 CR0: 0000000080050033
[  547.373489] CR2: 0000000000000010 CR3: 000000019585e001 CR4: 0000000000f71ef0
[  547.389321] PKRU: 55555554
