  CVE-2025-70071|2026-05-04T16:16:01.453|2026-05-05T19:47:31.297|5.9|MEDIUM|CWE-400|N/A|false|An issue in Assimp v.6.0.2 allows a remote attacker to cause a denial of service via the FBXParser.cpp, ParseVectorDataArray()|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-70071|0.00032|0.09077|4.1310
