  CVE-2026-7704|2026-05-03T17:16:13.580|2026-05-05T19:13:44.530|2.1|LOW|CWE-22|N/A|false|A vulnerability has been found in AV Stumpfl Pixera Two Media Server up to 25.1 R2. The affected element is an unknown function of the component Service Port 1338. Such manipulation leads to path traversal. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. Upgrading to version 25.2 R3 is sufficient to fix this issue. It is advisable to upgrade the affected component.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-7704|0.00017|0.03998|1.4705
